# DDS Generator STC8H1K28 + Si5351 + ILI9341 2.8"

DDS (Direct Digital Synthesizer) dari 10kHz sampai 160MHz menggunakan STC8H1K28, Si5351A, dan layar ILI9341 2.8" SPI.

## Hardware

### MCU
- **STC8H1K28 @ 24MHz** - 1T 8051, murah meriah

### Wiring

#### Si5351A -> STC8H1K28
| Si5351 | STC8H | Keterangan |
|--------|-------|------------|
| VCC | 3.3V | JANGAN 5V! |
| GND | GND | |
| SDA | P1.0 | I2C SDA |
| SCL | P1.1 | I2C SCL |
| XTAL | 25MHz | Onboard |

#### ILI9341 2.8" SPI -> STC8H1K28
| ILI9341 | STC8H | Keterangan |
|---------|-------|------------|
| VCC | 3.3V | |
| GND | GND | |
| CS | P2.0 | |
| DC | P2.1 | |
| RST | P2.2 | |
| MOSI | P2.3 | |
| SCK | P2.4 | |
| LED | 3.3V | Backlight |
| MISO | NC | Tidak dipakai |

#### Rotary Encoder (Opsional)
| Encoder | STC8H |
|---------|-------|
| CLK | P3.2 |
| DT | P3.3 |
| SW | P3.4 |

### Skema Blok
```
[Rotary Encoder] -> -> I2C -> -> RF OUT (CLK0)
                     |
                     +-> SPI -> [ILI9341 2.8" Display][STC8H1K28][Si5351A]
```

## Software

### Compile
1. Buka **Keil uVision 5**
2. New Project -> Pilih **STC8H1K28**
3. Add files: `main.c`, `si5351.c`, `ILI9341.c`
4. Clock = 24MHz
5. Build -> dapat file `.hex`

### Flash
- Pakai **STC-ISP Tool V6.90**
- Pilih STC8H1K28, Baudrate 115200
- Load .hex, klik Download
- Tekan reset di board STC

### Fitur
- Frekuensi 10kHz - 160MHz (Si5351)
- Tampilan frekuensi real-time di ILI9341
- Step: 1kHz, 10kHz, 100kHz, 1MHz (pakai encoder)
- Output CLK0 Si5351: 8mA drive, square wave ~3Vpp

### Cara Pakai Notepad Programmer
File `main.c` bisa dibuka di Notepad biasa om, tidak masalah. Yang penting saat compile pakai Keil C51, bukan Notepad.

